    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="structlibbirch_1_1Span" kindref="compound">Span</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>A <ref refid="structlibbirch_1_1Span" kindref="compound">Span</ref> describes one dimension of an array. It combines a <ref refid="structlibbirch_1_1Length" kindref="compound">Length</ref> and <ref refid="structlibbirch_1_1Stride" kindref="compound">Stride</ref> to indicate the size of the dimension. Each of these may have a static value (indicated by a template parameter giving that value) or a dynamic value (indicated by a template parameter of mutable_value and initial value given in the constructor). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
